OL,3,GNEWSATeenager charged with possession
OL,4,Aof bomb making supplies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old boy has appeared in court
OL,7,Fcharged with being in possession of
OL,8,Fbomb making supplies he had bought off
OL,9,Fthe internet.
OL,11,FThe teenager is charged with possessing
OL,12,Fexplosives in suspicious circumstances
OL,13,Fand possession of prohibited weapons
OL,14,Ffollowing a security alert in Omagh on
OL,15,FMonday.
OL,17,FDungannon Magistrates' Court heard that
OL,18,Fhe had been in possession of potassium
OL,19,Fnitrate and sulphur powder which he had
OL,20,Fbought online.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
