OL,3,GNEWSATeenager charged with possession
OL,4,Aof bomb making supplies
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing a call, police carried out a
OL,7,Fsearch of his home and bedroom and
OL,8,Ffound the substances along with three
OL,9,Fimprovised explosive devices, a taser,
OL,10,Fa stun gun, a combat uniform as well as
OL,11,Fitems for the production of counterfeit
OL,12,Fcash and bank cards.
